```
// Server-side pagination handler
function handlePagination(req, res) {
    // Validate page number input
    if (!req.query.page || !Number.isInteger(req.query.page)) {
        return res.status(400).send('Invalid page number');
    }

    // Get page number from request
    const pageNumber = req.query.page;

    // Fetch data from database with pagination limits
    const data = await fetchDataFromDatabase({ pageNumber });

    // Send only the current page data to the client
    res.send({ data: data.rows, totalPages: data.totalPages });
}
```

**Benefits of Server-Side Pagination:**

* Improved performance by reducing data transfer.
* Enhanced security by preventing client-side manipulation of page numbers.
