* **@ManyToOne:** Represents a many-to-one relationship between `CartItem` and `ProductModel`.
* **@JoinColumn(name = "idCarrito"):** Specifies that the `idCarrito` field of the `CartItem` table should be a foreign key referencing the `id` field of the `ProductModel` table.
* **@FetchType.LAZY:** Indicates that the `productModel` field should be lazily loaded from the database only when needed.
* **@CascadeType.ALL:** Specifies that any operations performed on the `ProductModel` object will be cascaded to the associated `CartItem` object.

